<title>JAPAN: Komatsu Store - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Komatsu Store - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		856    million	  vs	  898    million</p>
<p> Operating    loss 44    million	  vs     loss 7    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 48    million	  vs    loss 14    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 64    million	  vs    loss 36    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 17.14 yen	  vs     loss 9.71 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Komatsu Store Co Ltd is a retailer of high quality women&quot;s wear.</p>
</text>
